<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <base href="/" />
    <title>PES 17 League</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@600;700;800&family=Be+Vietnam+Pro:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@24,400..600,0..1,0&display=block" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="app.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="theme.css" />
    <link rel="manifest" href="manifest.webmanifest" />
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="icon-180.png" />
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes" />
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0f131d" />
    <HeadOutlet @rendermode="InteractiveServer" />
</head>
<body>
    <Routes @rendermode="InteractiveServer" />
    @* Mất kết nối (PO 17/11): thay bảng mặc định của Blazor bằng dải báo nhỏ; ui.js tự tải lại khi server đã khởi động lại. *@
    <div id="components-reconnect-modal" aria-live="polite">
        <span class="rc-show"><i class="ui-spin"></i> Đang kết nối lại…</span>
        <span class="rc-failed">Mất kết nối. <a href="" onclick="location.reload();return false">Tải lại</a></span>
        <span class="rc-rejected">Web vừa cập nhật — đang tải lại…</span>
    </div>
    <script src="controls.js"></script>
    <script src="lineup.js"></script>
    <script src="live.js"></script>
    <script src="ticker.js"></script>
    <script src="ui.js"></script>
    <script>document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const a=e.target.closest('[data-seek]');const v=a&&document.getElementById(a.dataset.seek);if(!v)return;e.preventDefault();const go=()=>{v.currentTime=+a.dataset.t;v.play();};v.readyState>0?go():(v.addEventListener('loadedmetadata',go,{once:true}),v.load());v.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});});</script>
    <script>window.pesPrefersReducedMotion=()=>matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;</script>
    <script src="_framework/blazor.web.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
